[00:02.25]I can feel the rain upon my skin
{"我能感受到雨水落在肌肤上"}
[00:07.10]It covers everything
{"它笼罩着万物"}
[00:12.73]But it's too late now
{"但为时已晚"}
[00:16.75]I remember you
{"我记得你"}
[00:19.85]And me
{"和我"}
